* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* CMRDC - Copy code to switch the Natural Data Collection (RDC)
*  Variables needed by this copycode: * +CMRDC  (A1) / #TRACING (L)
*
* Maintenance
* User ID   yyyy-mm-dd Issue         Remark
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------  --------
* fhi       2017-03-31 NOMALL-2009   Created
************************************************************************ ********
DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
  WHEN #TRACING AND  *MACHINE-CLASS = 'MAINFRAME' AND +CMRDC NE 'S'
    CALL 'CMRDC' 'S'
    CALL 'CMRDC' 'T' 'ALL'           /* Trace all events
    +CMRDC := 'S'
  WHEN NOT #TRACING AND  *MACHINE-CLASS = 'MAINFRAME' AND +CMRDC = 'S'
    CALL 'CMRDC' 'P'
    RESET +CMRDC
    FETCH RETURN 'RMRDCDSP'
  WHEN NONE
    IGNORE
END-DECIDE
** End of CC CMRDC *****************************************************
